  <entry>
    <title>高强度密码生成器 - OnePassJs</title>
    <link href="/2025/10-07-onepass-js/"/>
    <url>/2025/10-07-onepass-js/</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<link rel="stylesheet" href="ui-style.css" type="text/css" /><script src="onepass.js"></script><script src="ui-hook.js"></script><div class="onepass-container container-fluid">  <div class="form-group">    <label for="param1">Master Password:</label>    <input      type="password"      class="form-control"      id="param1"      placeholder="Enter your master password"    />  </div>  <div class="form-group">    <label for="param2">Site Name:</label>    <input      type="text"      class="form-control"      id="param2"      placeholder="Enter site name (e.g., example.com)"    />  </div>  <div class="form-group">    <label for="passwordLength"      >Password Length: <span id="lengthDisplay">16</span> characters</label    >    <input      type="range"      class="custom-range"      id="passwordLength"      min="8"      max="64"      value="16"    />  </div>  <div>    <input type="checkbox" id="specialChars" checked />    <label for="specialChars">Include Special Characters</label>  </div>  <div>    <input type="checkbox" id="capitalizeFirst" checked />    <label for="capitalizeFirst">Capitalize First Letter</label>  </div>  <div>    <input type="checkbox" id="savePassword" />    <label for="savePassword">Save Master Password (locally)</label>  </div>  <div class="mb-1 mt-3">    <button id="generateBtn" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg mr-2">      Generate Password    </button>    <button id="copyBtn" class="btn btn-secondary btn-lg ml-2">      Copy to Clipboard    </button>  </div>  <div class="form-group mb-5">    <label for="generatedPassword">Generated Password:</label>    <textarea      class="form-control"      id="generatedPassword"      rows="1"      readonly    ></textarea>  </div></div><script>  // 更新密码长度显示  document    .getElementById("passwordLength")    .addEventListener("input", function () {      document.getElementById("lengthDisplay").textContent = this.value;    });</script><blockquote><p>密码生成完全在本地运行，没有网络交互，也不会储存到本地（除了你自己选择的保存密码）。由浏览器提供 Crypto API 进行计算。<br>代码行为完全和 <a href="https://github.com/kaku2015/OnePassWindows">https://github.com/kaku2015/OnePassWindows</a> 相同。</p></blockquote>]]></content>
    
    
